{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_823129c27f86ce83761bae2662190a415db1d29325a00f882513833e664a033d", "title": "Heidi Horten", "text": "Heidi Horten (née Jelinek; born 13 February 1941) is an Austrian billionaire, and the widow of businessman Helmut Horten. In November 2015 \"Forbes\" estimated her net worth at US $2.6 billion.", "score": 41.2214}, {"id": "hp_doc_0b348b2ae351d36ad0c8fb7e70e744fba591939511dc7f09cd6cd30fc66fc569", "title": "Carinthia VII", "text": "The yacht Carinthia VII was built in the Lürssen Yachts yard in 2002 and refurbished in the same yard three years later. One of the largest motor yachts in the world, it is owned by Heidi Horten, widow of the German entrepreneur Helmut Horten.", "score": 21.0671}, {"id": "hp_doc_63512f4380731708e3d874e2bb8ca71a22e11ab1952f55d8caf66263ba2a92af", "title": "List of Pakistani politicians by net worth", "text": "This is the list of Pakistani politicians by net worth as per the media reports and asset declaration. As of 2008, former president Asif Ali Zardari is the richest Pakistani politician with net worth of US$35 billion and former Prime Minister Nawaz Sharif from Sharif family is 2nd richest for having net worth of US$30 billion. MNA Noor Alam Khan is also among the richest with assets worth US$800 million in 2013.", "score": 20.409}], "remaining_searches": 1}
